{"id":"8e620b5020310301","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy.md","title":"两种快增长层次","display":"df-fast-growing-hierarchy — 两种快增长层次","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy","aliases":["72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy"],"display":"df-fast-growing-hierarchy — 两种快增长层次","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Def.2.16(3); print158; PDF170","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","source_statement_status":"checked-against-book","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"补出增长递归的输出/下界契约"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fast-growing-hierarchy — 两种快增长层次"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Def.2.16(3); print158; PDF170"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-book"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"补出增长递归的输出/下界契约"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\Omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\omega\">\\(n,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{[k]}\">\\(f^{[k]}\\)</span> 表示下式定义的有限迭代；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,F:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(B,F:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 按树参数良基递归定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f^{[0]}(n)\\coloneqq n,\\qquad f^{[k+1]}(n)\\coloneqq f(f^{[k]}(n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f^{[0]}(n)\\coloneqq n,\\qquad f^{[k+1]}(n)\\coloneqq f(f^{[k]}(n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_{\\mathbf0}(n)\\coloneqq n+1,\\qquad B_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\coloneqq B_\\alpha(B_\\alpha(n)),\\qquad B_{\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega})}(n)\\coloneqq B_{\\alpha_n}(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_{\\mathbf0}(n)\\coloneqq n+1,\\qquad B_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\coloneqq B_\\alpha(B_\\alpha(n)),\\qquad B_{\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega})}(n)\\coloneqq B_{\\alpha_n}(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{\\mathbf0}(n)\\coloneqq n+1,\\qquad F_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\coloneqq F_\\alpha^{[n+1]}(n),\\qquad F_{\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega})}(n)\\coloneqq F_{\\alpha_n}(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{\\mathbf0}(n)\\coloneqq n+1,\\qquad F_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\coloneqq F_\\alpha^{[n+1]}(n),\\qquad F_{\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega})}(n)\\coloneqq F_{\\alpha_n}(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\Omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad n&lt;B_\\alpha(n)\\land n&lt;F_\\alpha(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha\\in\\Omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad n&lt;B_\\alpha(n)\\land n&lt;F_\\alpha(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第 III 章 Definition 2.16(3)，印刷 p.158 / PDF p.170；已目视核对迭代次数是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span>。两种层次的后继操作不同，不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的两次复合与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的输入依赖迭代混为一谈。先在自然数上定义有限迭代，再按树秩定义函数层次，故嵌套调用仍是唯一确定的自然数值。</p>\n<p>本轮深审：零分支加一，后继的两次复合或至少一次有限迭代保持严格增加，极限直接读取子树。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]；$\\alpha\\in\\Omega$，$n,k\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"n,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f^{[k]}","display":false},{"tex":"B,F:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f^{[0]}(n)\\coloneqq n,\\qquad f^{[k+1]}(n)\\coloneqq f(f^{[k]}(n)).","display":true},{"tex":"B_{\\mathbf0}(n)\\coloneqq n+1,\\qquad B_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\coloneqq B_\\alpha(B_\\alpha(n)),\\qquad B_{\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega})}(n)\\coloneqq B_{\\alpha_n}(n).","display":true},{"tex":"F_{\\mathbf0}(n)\\coloneqq n+1,\\qquad F_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\coloneqq F_\\alpha^{[n+1]}(n),\\qquad F_{\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega})}(n)\\coloneqq F_{\\alpha_n}(n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\Omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad n<B_\\alpha(n)\\land n<F_\\alpha(n).","display":true},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":1940,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-213","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy|df-fast-growing-hierarchy — 两种快增长层次]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-fast-growing-hierarchy — 两种快增长层次](72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-228","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy|df-fast-growing-hierarchy — 两种快增长层次]]"},{"id":"4abdfa23c470566c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B,F$ 与有限函数迭代 $f^{[k]}$ 见 [[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]；$H$、$\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow},\\overline k,\\boldsymbol\\omega$ 及加法复合恒等式见 [[72-lem-hardy-addition-composition]]。"},{"id":"f6e6568ea7b179d6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G,H,B,F$ 分别见 [[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"8d01f06a62827a91","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]$ 及递增穷尽见 [[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]；$G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|$ 与有限树序数 $\\overline k$ 见 [[72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism]]；$H,B,F$ 及有限迭代见 [[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"7ce9e286b350fbfc","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["2e4aa3df9477aa6f"]}